        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161916643?u=ac460ddbb1c07a3453efc41c8bbb87d21b4878a5&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates the interactive example for the </p> element.<br>\nThe original code used nested  elements for each daily weather forecast, which is semantically incorrect because these items are not independently meaningful or distributable.<p dir=\"auto\"></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Each day’s forecast depends on the main forecast, so they should be grouped using </p><section> elements instead.<p dir=\"auto\"></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/161916643/524452711-d09bdc2b-12c4-428b-bd89-8bac2c69c5fc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NjUzMTA3ODQsIm5iZiI6MTc2NTMxMDQ4NCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xNjE5MTY2NDMvNTI0NDUyNzExLWQwOWJkYzJiLTEyYzQtNDI4Yi1iZDg5LThiYWMyYzY5YzVmYy5wbmc_.ia6KF1hjoELXclvtIVKSk5IX9a-23HN87oZo6GJiJK8\"><img width=\"783\" height=\"513\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/161916643/524452711-d09bdc2b-12c4-428b-bd89-8bac2c69c5fc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NjUzMTA3ODQsIm5iZiI6MTc2NTMxMDQ4NCwicGF0aCI6Ii8xNjE5MTY2NDMvNTI0NDUyNzExLWQwOWJkYzJiLTEyYzQtNDI4Yi1iZDg5LThiYWMyYzY5YzVmYy5wbmc_.ia6KF1hjoELXclvtIVKSk5IX9a-23HN87oZo6GJiJK8\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 513px;\"></a></section>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42328",
            "title": "Article element in a wrong implementation #38324",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-09T18:17:17.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-09T18:16:39.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Abhi-Sharma",
