        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20392302?u=5dcac116a63e4eaf0fd7243fdf8e9139962831ae&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Clarified requirements for cross-origin isolation and resource embedding.</p>\n\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42236.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3697342839\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42236\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42236/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42236\">#42236</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
