        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change addresses the dev-docs-needed requirement of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1773681\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1773681</a> Enable showing \"Paste\" button for <code class=\"notranslate\">navigator.clipboard.readText()</code> when called from Addons which don't have <code class=\"notranslate\">clipboardRead</code> permssion.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The changes include:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>a release note.</li>\n<li>an update to the Interact with the clipboard article. In addition to aligning the documentation with this change, references to the deprecated <code class=\"notranslate\">document.execCommand</code> methods were removed.</li>\n<li>an update to the clipboard section on the Pesmissions page to remove references to the deprecated <code class=\"notranslate\">document.execCommand</code> methods.</li>\n<li>an update to the Clipboard API overview page's Security consideration section to align the documentation with this change.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Notes in the BCD updated in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3699897493\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28587\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28587/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28587\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28587</a></p>",
